<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's coffee imports to drop 0.5 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Morocco's coffee imports to drop 0.5 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's coffee total imports are expected to drop 5.0 percent to 19,000 tonnes by end 1996 compared with last year, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Morocco imported 20,000 tonnes of coffee in 1995 at cost of 513 million dirhams ($60 million), a Moroccan trader said.</p>
</text>
